---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact Entif AI about Rosetta research, implementation, collaboration, and public technical work."
>
  <section class="section shell topic-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Start with the work.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        For now, GitHub is Entif AI's public coordination surface for Rosetta
        research, implementation proposals, technical questions, and reviewable
        collaboration.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/entif-ai/rosetta"
          >Visit the Rosetta repository</a
        >
        to inspect the current work, open an issue, or join an existing technical
        thread.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
